59|// Once the pending row has resolved to a commit, the hash is written back into
60|// the ledger itself, so the regenerate that resolves it leaves no `pending` row
61|// behind (Oct 31: the row for afbb63c had stayed `pending` past its regenerate).
62|// Only the hash cell of the row changes; the text is left as written.
