45|export const INTAKE_PROMPT = 'Read this one-page claim denial letter and return the eight fields as the JSON object the schema describes: the CARC number, the reviewer\'s remark copied exactly, the first and last dates of service on the claim line (last date empty when a single date is printed), the billing code and its code system, the billed amount as a number, and the payer\'s name from the letterhead. This is administrative intake only.';
